
% Unconditionally

a: vi | IV | I | . . . V |
In: vi | IV | I | . . . V |
Vr: $a*2
Ch: $a*2
PostCh: $a*2
drop: vi | IV | I | . . R |
Vr_drop: $a $drop
drop_2: vi | IV | I | . . R |
Vr_drop2: $a $drop_2
b: vi | IV | I |
bridge: $b $drop_2
S: [G] $In $Vr $Vr_drop $Ch*2 $Vr $Vr_drop2 $Ch*2 $PostCh $bridge $Ch*2 $PostCh*2
